HIPAA Security Rule 
45 CFR Part 164, Subpart C 
Establishes security requirements for protecting electronic patient information. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Administrative Safeguards 
45 CFR §164.308 
Guides risk management, user responsibilities, and workforce access procedures. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Physical Safeguards 
45 CFR §164.310 
Guides protection of tablets, workstations, devices, and physical access to the system. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Technical Safeguards 
45 CFR §164.312 
Supports authentication, access control, audit logging, data integrity, and secure transmission. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Security Documentation 
45 CFR §164.316 
Establishes requirements for maintaining security policies, procedures, and documentation. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NIST Digital Identity Guidelines 
NIST SP 800-63B-4 
Provides guidance for password security, authentication, and multifactor authentication. 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NIST Transport Layer Security Guidelines 
NIST SP 800-52 Rev. 2 
Provides guidance for configuring secure TLS communications between system components. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OWASP Application Security Verification Standard 
OWASP ASVS 5.0 
Provides security requirements for application development, authentication, authorization, and data protection. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OWASP Password Storage Guidelines 
Password Storage Cheat Sheet 
Recommends secure password hashing and protection of stored credentials. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Health Level Seven Messaging Standard 
HL7 Version 2 (HL7v2) 
Defines the healthcare messaging format used for communication 
